<dl class="meta">
<dt><span lang="de">Batteriepass-Kennung</span><span lang="en">Battery passport identifier</span></dt><dd><a href="https://passport.musterwerk.example/battery/MW-IND-2026-000007"><code>https://passport.musterwerk.example/battery/MW-IND-2026-000007</code></a></dd>
<dt><span lang="de">Batteriekategorie</span><span lang="en">Battery category</span></dt><dd><span lang="de">Industriebatterie &gt; 2 kWh</span><span lang="en">Industrial battery &gt; 2 kWh</span> (<code>INDUSTRIAL_GT_2KWH</code>)</dd>
<dt><span lang="de">Entwurf angelegt</span><span lang="en">Draft created</span></dt><dd>2026-09-03T12:00:00Z</dd>

