<h3><span lang="de">Zyklenzähler des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS) cycle counter.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Anzahl der Vollzyklen</span><span lang="en">Number of full charging and discharging cycles</span><br><code>numberOfFullCycles</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 4 (d)<br>DIN longlist: Annex XIII (4d); Art. 14: Annex VII Part B (5)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Zyklenzähler des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS) cycle counter.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Energiezähler des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS) energy counter.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Energiedurchsatz</span><span lang="en">Energy throughput</span><br><code>energyThroughput</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>DIN longlist: Annex VII Part B (2)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Energiezähler des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS) energy counter.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Ereignisprotokoll des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS) event log.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Anzahl der Tiefentladungen</span><span lang="en">Number of deep discharge events</span><br><code>deepDischargeEvents</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 4 (d)<br>DIN longlist: Annex VII Part B (4)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Ereignisprotokoll des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS) event log.</span></td></tr>
<tr><td><span lang="de">Anzahl der Überladungen</span><span lang="en">Number of overcharge events</span><br><code>overchargeEvents</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 4 (d)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Ereignisprotokoll des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS) event log.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Batteriemanagementsystem (BMS) oder periodische Messungen des Betreibers.</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS) or the operator&#39;s periodic measurements.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Entwicklung der Selbstentladungsrate</span><span lang="en">Evolution of self-discharge rates</span><br><code>evolutionOfSelfDischarge</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 4 (b)<br>DIN longlist: Art. 14: Annex VII Part A (4)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Batteriemanagementsystem (BMS) oder periodische Messungen des Betreibers.</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS) or the operator&#39;s periodic measurements.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Temperatursensoren des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS); protokolliert vom Betreiber.</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS) temperature sensors; logged by the operator.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Temperaturinformation (Betriebsbedingungen)</span><span lang="en">Temperature information (operating conditions)</span><br><code>temperatureInformation</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 4 (d)<br>DIN longlist: Annex XIII (4d)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Temperatursensoren des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS); protokolliert vom Betreiber.</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS) temperature sensors; logged by the operator.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Batteriemanagementsystem (BMS), sofern das BMS den Wert bestimmen kann.</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS), where the BMS can determine it.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Verbleibender Round-Trip-Wirkungsgrad</span><span lang="en">Remaining round trip energy efficiency</span><br><code>remainingRoundTripEnergyEfficiency</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 4 (b)<br>DIN longlist: Art. 10: Annex IV Part A (4) (only definition); Article 14: Annex VII Part A (3)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Batteriemanagementsystem (BMS), sofern das BMS den Wert bestimmen kann.</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS), where the BMS can determine it.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Batteriemanagementsystem (BMS); ausgelesen von Betreiber oder Werkstatt.</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS); read out by the operator or workshop.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Verbleibende Leistungsfähigkeit</span><span lang="en">Remaining power capability</span><br><code>remainingPowerCapability</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 4 (b)<br>DIN longlist: Art. 10: Annex IV (3) (only definition of power); Annex VII Part A (2) &quot;where possible, remaining power capability&quot;; Annex IV Part B (4) --&gt; measurement at 80 % SoC and 20% SoC required</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Batteriemanagementsystem (BMS); ausgelesen von Betreiber oder Werkstatt.</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS); read out by the operator or workshop.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Batteriemanagementsystem (BMS); ausgelesen von Betreiber, Flottenmanager oder Werkstatt.</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS); read out by the operator, fleet manager or workshop.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Restkapazität</span><span lang="en">Remaining capacity</span><br><code>remainingCapacity</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 4 (b)<br>DIN longlist: Annex VII Part A (1)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Batteriemanagementsystem (BMS); ausgelesen von Betreiber, Flottenmanager oder Werkstatt.</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS); read out by the operator, fleet manager or workshop.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Batteriemanagementsystem (BMS); periodisch vom Betreiber aufgezeichnet.</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS); recorded periodically by the operator.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Ladezustand (SoC)</span><span lang="en">State of charge (SoC)</span><br><code>stateOfCharge</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 4 (d)<br>DIN longlist: Annex XIII (4d); Article 3 1(27)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Batteriemanagementsystem (BMS); periodisch vom Betreiber aufgezeichnet.</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS); recorded periodically by the operator.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Prüflabor des Zell- oder Pack-Herstellers; im Zyklentest-Bericht genannt.</span><span lang="en">Cell or pack manufacturer&#39;s test laboratory; named in the cycle-life test report.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Referenztest für die Zyklenlebensdauer</span><span lang="en">Cycle-life reference test</span><br><code>cycleLifeReferenceTest</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 1 (j)<br>DIN longlist: Annex XIII (1j)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Prüflabor des Zell- oder Pack-Herstellers; im Zyklentest-Bericht genannt.</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Cell or pack manufacturer&#39;s test laboratory; named in the cycle-life test report.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">EHS-Abteilung; die Gefahrenhinweise stehen im Sicherheitsdatenblatt, Abschnitt 2.</span><span lang="en">EHS department; the hazard statements are in the safety data sheet, section 2.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Auswirkungen der Stoffe auf Umwelt, Gesundheit und Sicherheit</span><span lang="en">Impact of substances on environment, health and safety</span><br><code>substanceImpacts</code></td><td><span lang="de">Pflicht</span><span lang="en">required</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 1 (s)<br>DIN longlist: Annex XIII (1s); Art. 74 1(f)</td><td><span lang="de">Diesen Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: EHS-Abteilung; die Gefahrenhinweise stehen im Sicherheitsdatenblatt, Abschnitt 2.</span><span lang="en">Request this value. Typical data holder: EHS department; the hazard statements are in the safety data sheet, section 2.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Betreiber, Flottenmanager, Versicherer oder Werkstatt; nach dem Ereignis dokumentiert und dem Pass beigefügt.</span><span lang="en">Operator, fleet manager, insurer or workshop; documented after the event and attached to the passport.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Informationen zu Unfällen</span><span lang="en">Information on accidents</span><br><code>informationOnAccidents</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 4 (d)<br>DIN longlist: Annex XIII (4d)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Betreiber, Flottenmanager, Versicherer oder Werkstatt; nach dem Ereignis dokumentiert und dem Pass beigefügt.</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Operator, fleet manager, insurer or workshop; documented after the event and attached to the passport.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Stückliste des Pack-Herstellers (ERP/PLM); austauschbare Komponenten wie Module, BMS, Sicherungen, Stecker.</span><span lang="en">Pack manufacturer&#39;s bill of materials (ERP/PLM); replaceable components such as modules, BMS, fuses, connectors.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Teilenummern der Komponenten</span><span lang="en">Part numbers for components</span><br><code>componentPartNumbers</code></td><td><span lang="de">Pflicht</span><span lang="en">required</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 2 (b)<br>DIN longlist: Annex XIII (2b)</td><td><span lang="de">Diesen Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Stückliste des Pack-Herstellers (ERP/PLM); austauschbare Komponenten wie Module, BMS, Sicherungen, Stecker.</span><span lang="en">Request this value. Typical data holder: Pack manufacturer&#39;s bill of materials (ERP/PLM); replaceable components such as modules, BMS, fuses, connectors.</span></td></tr></table>
<footer>
<p><span lang="de">Dieses Dokument ist keine Rechtsberatung. Jede rechtliche Aussage stammt aus den zitierten Quellen.</span><span lang="en">This document is not legal advice. Every legal statement comes from the cited sources.</span></p>
<p><span lang="de">Quellen</span><span lang="en">Sources</span>: Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, Annex XIII and Annex VI Part A; European Commission, Guidance Document &#39;Digital Batteries Passport - data points by category&#39;, version 2.0; DIN DKE SPEC 99100; IDTA 02035-1 to -7</p>
<p><span lang="de">Wissensbasis abgerufen am</span><span lang="en">Knowledge base retrieved</span> 2026-09-03. <span lang="de">Erzeugt mit passwerk</span><span lang="en">Generated with passwerk</span>.</p>
</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
"
`;

exports[`emitHtml > industrial-valid: valid, both languages, snapshot in de and en 2`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
