<h2><span lang="de">Offene Datenpunkte</span><span lang="en">Open data points</span></h2><p><span lang="de">Vollständigkeit</span><span lang="en">Completeness</span>: <span lang="de">Pflicht</span><span lang="en">mandatory</span> 34/36 (94.4 %), <span lang="de">gesamt</span><span lang="en">overall</span> 46/65 (70.8 %)</p><h3><span lang="de">Ladungszähler des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS) charge counter.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Kapazitätsdurchsatz</span><span lang="en">Capacity throughput</span><br><code>capacityThroughput</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>DIN longlist: Annex VII Part B (3)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Ladungszähler des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS) charge counter.</span></td></tr></table>
