<h2><span lang="de">Offene Datenpunkte</span><span lang="en">Open data points</span></h2><p><span lang="de">Vollständigkeit</span><span lang="en">Completeness</span>: <span lang="de">Pflicht</span><span lang="en">mandatory</span> 39/49 (79.6 %), <span lang="de">gesamt</span><span lang="en">overall</span> 42/65 (64.6 %)</p><h3><span lang="de">After-Sales- oder Serviceabteilung des Pack-Herstellers; oft der Hersteller selbst plus autorisierte Servicepartner.</span><span lang="en">After-sales or service department of the pack manufacturer; often the manufacturer itself plus authorised service partners.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Bezugsquellen für Ersatzteile</span><span lang="en">Sources for replacement spare parts</span><br><code>sparePartSources</code></td><td><span lang="de">Pflicht</span><span lang="en">required</span></td><td>BR Annex XIII 2 (b)<br>DIN longlist: Annex XIII (2b)</td><td><span lang="de">Diesen Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: After-Sales- oder Serviceabteilung des Pack-Herstellers; oft der Hersteller selbst plus autorisierte Servicepartner.</span><span lang="en">Request this value. Typical data holder: After-sales or service department of the pack manufacturer; often the manufacturer itself plus authorised service partners.</span></td></tr></table>
<h3><span lang="de">Ladungszähler des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS) charge counter.</span></h3><table><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr><tr><td><span lang="de">Kapazitätsdurchsatz</span><span lang="en">Capacity throughput</span><br><code>capacityThroughput</code></td><td><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td>DIN longlist: Annex VII Part B (3)</td><td><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Ladungszähler des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS) charge counter.</span></td></tr></table>
